    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Brophy Estates are delighted to present 15 Waterside Rise to the market. This well-maintained three-bedroom, three-bathroom property offers spacious and versatile accommodation, complemented by a private rear garden and excellent transport links.\r\n\r\nOn the ground floor, the property comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a spacious living room and a bright dining area/kitchen. Double doors provide direct access to the private rear garden, which features mature planting and two separate patio areas, making it ideal for outdoor entertaining and relaxation.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three generously proportioned bedrooms, with the principal bedroom benefiting from its own ensuite bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from a designated parking space, together with ample visitor parking.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned within the popular Waterside development, the property is conveniently located close to the amenities of both Malahide and Swords. Malahide village offers an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and recreational amenities, including the beautiful Malahide Castle, marina and scenic coastal walks.\r\n\r\nThe property is also well served by transport links, with easy access to local bus routes, Malahide DART station, the M1, M50 and Dublin Airport.\r\n\r\nAn excellent opportunity to acquire a well-appointed home in a highly convenient and sought-after location.\r\n\r\nManagement fee approx : €400 per annum"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation :\r\n\r\nFoyer : 1.45m x 2.36m \r\n\r\nHallway : 1.87m x 4.16m\r\n\r\nLiving Room : 3.06m x 5.42m \r\n\r\nDining Area : 2.15m x 3.11m \r\n\r\nKitchen : 2.87m x 3.10m\r\n\r\nBathroom : 1.41m x 2.02m \r\n\r\nMain Bedroom : 2.95m x 3.63m\r\n\r\nEnsuite : 2.25m x 1.00m \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 : 2.96m x 3.80m\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 : 2.97m x 3.38m \r\n\r\nMain Bathroom : 1.98m x 2.22m"
      },
